function update(dt){
 T.time+=dt;if(T.time>=DAYLEN){T.time-=DAYLEN;T.day++}
 updPlayer(dt);
 P.inside=insideHouse();
 for(const e of E.slice())updEnemy(e,dt);
 for(let i=0;i<E.length;i++)for(let j=i+1;j<E.length;j++){const a=E[i],b=E[j],dx=b.x-a.x,dy=b.y-a.y,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy),m=a.r+b.r;if(d<m&&d>1e-4){const p=(m-d)*.25;moveEnt(a,-dx/d*p,-dy/d*p);moveEnt(b,dx/d*p,dy/d*p)}}
 E=E.filter(e=>ED[e.t].boss||Math.hypot(e.x-P.x,e.y-P.y)<36);
 updSpawner(dt);updBoss();
 for(let i=falling.length-1;i>=0;i--){const o=falling[i];o.fall.t+=dt;if(o.fall.t>=.9){falling.splice(i,1);treeImpact(o)}}
 for(let i=regrow.length-1;i>=0;i--){const o=regrow[i];o.rg-=dt;if(o.rg<=0){o.gone=false;regrow.splice(i,1)}}
 for(const o of res)if(o.shake>0)o.shake-=dt;
 for(let i=proj.length-1;i>=0;i--){const q=proj[i];q.t-=dt;q.x+=q.dx*q.spd*dt;q.y+=q.dy*q.spd*dt;if(q.t<=0||solid(q.x,q.y,.05,3)){burst(q.x,q.y,.5,'#d8c9a0',3);proj.splice(i,1)}else if(!P.dead&&Math.hypot(q.x-P.x,q.y-P.y)<.45){proj.splice(i,1);hitPlayer(q.dmg,q.src)}}
 for(let i=debris.length-1;i>=0;i--){const d=debris[i];d.vz-=22*dt;d.zf+=d.vz*dt;
  if(d.zf<=0){debris.splice(i,1);const dc=pieceCenter(d);d.x=dc[0]-.5;d.y=dc[1]-.5;for(const e of E.slice())if(Math.hypot(e.x-d.x-.5,e.y-d.y-.5)<.9)dmgEnemy(e,20,d.x+.5,d.y+.5,5);
   if(!P.dead&&Math.hypot(P.x-d.x-.5,P.y-d.y-.5)<.9&&P.iframes<=0)hurtPlayer(8);
   burst(d.x+.5,d.y+.5,.2,'#b5a98a',6);shake=Math.max(shake,3);if(rnd()<.4){const t=BT[d.type];const id=Object.keys(t.cost)[0];give(id,1)}}}
 for(let i=parts.length-1;i>=0;i--){const p=parts[i];p.t-=dt;p.vz-=14*dt;p.x+=p.vx*dt;p.y+=p.vy*dt;p.z+=p.vz*dt;if(p.z<0){if(p.bl){stain(p.x,p.y,rr(.08,.2));p.t=0}else{p.z=0;p.vz*=-.3}}if(p.t<=0)parts.splice(i,1)}
 for(let i=floats.length-1;i>=0;i--){floats[i].t-=dt;if(floats[i].t<=0)floats.splice(i,1)}
 for(const b of stations)if((b.type==='hoguera'||b.type==='forja')&&smoke.length<140&&Math.hypot(b.x-P.x,b.y-P.y)<24&&rnd()<dt*(b.type==='hoguera'?9:5))smoke.push({x:b.x+.5+rr(-.08,.08),y:b.y+.5+rr(-.08,.08),z:b.type==='forja'?1.3:.5,vx:rr(.1,.3),vy:rr(-.25,-.05),vz:rr(.8,1.3),t:2.8,t0:2.8});
 for(let i=smoke.length-1;i>=0;i--){const q=smoke[i];q.t-=dt;q.x+=q.vx*dt;q.y+=q.vy*dt;q.z+=q.vz*dt;q.vz*=.99;if(q.t<=0)smoke.splice(i,1)}
 for(const d of doors){const dcen=pieceCenter(d),cx=dcen[0],cy=dcen[1];let near=!P.dead&&Math.hypot(P.x-cx,P.y-cy)<1.5;if(!near)for(const e of E)if(Math.hypot(e.x-cx,e.y-cy)<1.2){near=true;break}
  if(near){if(!(d.hold>0)&&!(d.open>0))d.side=((d.o|0)?P.x-cx:P.y-cy)>=0?-1:1;d.hold=.7}else d.hold=Math.max(0,(d.hold||0)-dt);
  d.open=clamp((d.open||0)+(d.hold>0?dt*5:-dt*3),0,1)}
 camZ+=(elevAt(P.x,P.y)-camZ)*Math.min(1,dt*5);camX+=(P.x-camX)*Math.min(1,dt*8);camY+=(P.y-camY)*Math.min(1,dt*8);
 revealAround();
 goalT-=dt;if(goalT<=0){goalT=.5;const g=GOALS.findIndex(x=>!x[1]());S.goal=g<0?GOALS.length-1:g}
 saveT+=dt;if(saveT>15){saveT=0;save()}
 if(build.on){refreshBuild()}}
function updPlayer(dt){
 if(P.dead){P.respT-=dt;if(P.respT<=0)respawn();return}
 for(const k of['atkCd','swing','hurt','crit','iframes','stun','roll','regDelay','poison','debuff','lock'])P[k]-=dt;
 if(P.eating){P.eating.t+=dt;if(P.eating.t>=P.eating.dur)finishEat()}
 if(P.hq){P.hq.t-=dt;if(P.hq.t<=0){const w=P.hq.w;P.hq=null;resolveHit(w)}}
 for(const f of P.foods)f.rem-=dt;P.foods=P.foods.filter(f=>f.rem>0);recalc();
 const k=IN.keys;let ix=IN.ix,iy=IN.iy;
 if(k.a||k.arrowleft)ix-=1;if(k.d||k.arrowright)ix+=1;if(k.w||k.arrowup)iy-=1;if(k.s||k.arrowdown)iy+=1;
 const m=Math.hypot(ix,iy);if(m>1){ix/=m;iy/=m}
 let wx=ix+iy,wy=-ix+iy;const wm=Math.hypot(wx,wy);if(wm>0){wx/=wm;wy/=wm}
 if(m>.12&&build.on)build.manual=false;
 P.guard=IN.guard&&P.stun<=0&&P.roll<=0&&P.lock<=0&&!P.dead;P.guardT=P.guard?P.guardT+dt:0;
 if(IN.atk)doAttack();
 if(P.roll>0){const sp=7.5;moveEnt(P,P.rdx*sp*dt,P.rdy*sp*dt)}
 else if(P.stun<=0&&P.lock<=0&&m>.12){const sp=3.6*(P.guard?.5:1)*(inWater(P.x,P.y)?.65:1)*(P.debuff>0?.92:1)*Math.min(1,m*1.2);moveEnt(P,wx*sp*dt,wy*sp*dt);if(P.swing<=0&&!P.guard){P.fx=wx;P.fy=wy}}
 const b=biomeAt(P.x,P.y),fire=nearStation('hoguera',6)||nearStation('forja',4);
 P.cold=b===3&&!P.inv.capa&&!fire;if(b===3)S.mtn=true;
 if(P.regDelay<=0&&!P.guard)P.st=Math.min(P.stMax,P.st+(P.cold?4:9)*dt);
 P.hp=Math.min(P.hpMax,P.hp+(.08+P.rg+(fire?.4:0))*dt);
 if(P.poison>0)P.hp-=1.4*dt;if(P.cold)P.hp-=.6*dt;
 if(P.hp<=0&&!P.dead)die();
 nearRes(P.x,P.y,.8,o=>{if(!o.gone&&(o.t==='stick'||o.t==='stone')&&Math.hypot(o.x-P.x,o.y-P.y)<.8){o.gone=true;removed.add(o.id);give(o.t==='stick'?'madera':'piedra',1)}});
 if(tomb&&Math.hypot(tomb.x-P.x,tomb.y-P.y)<1){for(const id in tomb.inv)P.inv[id]=(P.inv[id]|0)+tomb.inv[id];tomb=null;toast('Has recuperado tus cosas');snd(500,.2,'triangle',.07,300)}}
function dodge(){if(P.dead||P.roll>0||P.stun>0||P.lock>0)return;const cost=14*(S.f.boss?.8:1);if(P.st<cost){toast('Sin estamina');return}
 P.st-=cost;P.regDelay=1;P.roll=.34;P.iframes=.3;let ix=IN.ix,iy=IN.iy;const k=IN.keys;if(k.a)ix-=1;if(k.d)ix+=1;if(k.w)iy-=1;if(k.s)iy+=1;
 let wx=ix+iy,wy=-ix+iy;const wm=Math.hypot(wx,wy);if(wm>.1){P.rdx=wx/wm;P.rdy=wy/wm}else{P.rdx=-P.fx;P.rdy=-P.fy}
 P.fx=P.rdx;P.fy=P.rdy;snd(200,.15,'sine',.05,200)}
function useAct(){
 if(P.dead)return;
 let bs=null,bd=2.5;for(const b of stations){const t=b.type;if(t!=='cofre'&&t!=='banco'&&t!=='forja'&&t!=='hoguera')continue;const d=Math.hypot(P.x-b.x-.5,P.y-b.y-.5);if(d<bd){bd=d;bs=b}}
 if(bs){if(bs.type==='cofre'){chestOpen=bs;openSheet('chest')}else{stOpen=bs.type;openSheet('st')}snd(400,.08,'triangle',.05);return}
 let t=null;nearRes(P.x,P.y,1.8,o=>{if(!o.gone&&(o.t==='bush'||o.t==='mush')&&!t)t=o});
 if(t){harvest(t,WEAP.punos);snd(520,.06,'triangle');return}
 if(Math.hypot(P.x-altar.x,P.y-altar.y)<5){toast(S.f.boss?'El altar brilla: el Guardián ha caído.':'Un altar antiguo… algo duerme cerca.');return}
 toast('Nada con lo que interactuar')}
